{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36288","headline":"题澄圣塔院上方 · 方干","name":"题澄圣塔院上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地灵直是饶风雨，杉桧老於云雨间。\n只讶窗中常见海，方知砌下更多山。\n远泉势曲犹须引，野果枝低可要攀。\n若把重门谕玄寂，何妨善闭却无关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}